          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is the NordicTrack Commercial 2950 worth the price?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Only for a specific type of buyer: someone who runs regularly,
              values the largest touchscreen NordicTrack makes, and won't
